WEBVTT

00:01.460 --> 00:06.780
As you heard, this town is currently
at the Witch Cult's mercy.

00:07.220 --> 00:10.240
They will not hesitate
to punish any careless behavior.

00:10.670 --> 00:12.530
I understand about the Witch Cult,

00:12.530 --> 00:14.610
but before winding up here,

00:14.610 --> 00:17.040
I ran into someone
who called herself an Archbishop.

00:17.040 --> 00:21.290
But she was Wrath, not Lust.

00:21.290 --> 00:26.800
Yes.
There are multiple Archbishops in this town.

00:26.800 --> 00:28.590
Lord Husband is one of them.

00:28.590 --> 00:31.430
Regulus is... an Archbishop?!

00:31.940 --> 00:33.350
Does that mean...

00:33.350 --> 00:37.010
I'm the "silver-haired maiden"
they were talking about?

00:37.890 --> 00:43.900
And if I run away, they'll sink Pristella?

00:44.250 --> 00:47.900
Now that you understand,
please get changed.

00:52.250 --> 00:53.460
Subaru...

00:54.080 --> 00:57.580
You mentioned that name before too.

00:58.260 --> 00:59.290
Is it a man?

01:00.070 --> 01:00.960
Yes.

01:02.600 --> 01:04.230
He's my knight.

01:33.200 --> 01:34.490
Foolish peasant.

01:35.700 --> 01:39.910
How long must you flaunt that clueless,
carefree face of yours?

01:44.200 --> 01:45.290
Priscilla?!

01:45.290 --> 01:46.920
Who else could it be?

01:47.370 --> 01:50.790
Did I fall in the waterway?
Was there a flood?

01:50.790 --> 01:53.090
Exactly, Sir Natsuki!

01:53.090 --> 01:57.220
Your humble Liliana is so shaken
that her legs won't stop trembling!

01:57.220 --> 01:59.930
It's almost like I invented a new dance!

01:59.930 --> 02:01.810
Liliana! You're okay!

02:01.810 --> 02:07.570
Shortly after you left the park,
that vulgar broadcast began.

02:08.270 --> 02:14.530
Afterward, the watergates were released,
flooding the city in its entirety.

02:18.700 --> 02:19.990
My foot...

02:20.610 --> 02:21.580
...is still here?

02:25.560 --> 02:27.690
Wh-Whatever is the matter?

02:29.710 --> 02:32.010
Wh-What the heck is that?!

02:32.490 --> 02:35.400
Th-This isn't healing magic, is it?

02:37.810 --> 02:38.970
Remain silent.

02:50.270 --> 02:53.650
Capella dripped some blood on my foot...

02:53.650 --> 02:54.740
It was dragon blood!

02:55.110 --> 02:56.450
Ah, dragon blood.

02:56.450 --> 03:01.330
One of the three treasures bestowed by
the Divine Dragon upon the Lugnican royalty.

03:03.670 --> 03:07.790
♪ It brings abundance
to lands withered and dry ♪

03:07.790 --> 03:12.050
♪ Restores what destruction has left awry ♪

03:12.430 --> 03:21.010
♪ And cures the most hopeless of illnesses
in the blink of an eye ♪

03:23.210 --> 03:24.980
That was a verse from the fellowship

03:24.980 --> 03:28.520
of the Divine Dragon Volcanica passed down
in the Kingdom of Lugnica.

03:28.520 --> 03:31.980
That dragon blood sounds like
it can do anything.

03:34.180 --> 03:38.240
I see. It seems it only heals your foot.

03:38.240 --> 03:40.780
Stop go stabbing me so casually!

03:42.120 --> 03:45.040
So, what happened to the others?

03:45.040 --> 03:49.130
Where are Garfiel and Wilhelm?
What about Ms. Crusch?

03:49.460 --> 03:52.340
I don't know about them,

03:52.340 --> 03:57.300
but we were lucky
the gate closed right after opening.

03:57.300 --> 04:00.180
Most of the citizens evacuated safely.

04:00.620 --> 04:06.580
The Archbishop claiming to be Lust
has made three new demands.

04:06.580 --> 04:09.100
But judging by your face,
it seems this is news to you.

04:09.100 --> 04:10.690
Three new demands...?

04:10.690 --> 04:11.610
Correct.

04:11.610 --> 04:15.400
In addition to the Witch's bones
sleeping in this city,

04:15.400 --> 04:19.410
she demands the Book of Wisdom,
the artificial spirit,

04:19.410 --> 04:20.800
and...

04:22.250 --> 04:24.990
The wedding of the silver-haired maiden.

04:27.760 --> 04:31.080
Now, what will you do about it, peasant?

04:31.920 --> 04:33.540
Agh, damn it!

04:33.540 --> 04:36.300
I'm not staying beaten forever, damn it!

04:36.300 --> 04:38.220
Bring it on!

04:39.590 --> 04:40.930
I'm surprised.

04:41.320 --> 04:45.390
So you will not break
over this trivial matter?

04:45.390 --> 04:47.060
Damn right I won't!

04:47.060 --> 04:51.690
We'll regroup and kick those asswipes
out of this city once and for all!

04:52.390 --> 04:53.650
Can you even do that?

04:53.650 --> 04:56.070
It's not a question
of whether we can or can't!

04:56.070 --> 04:57.650
We either do it or we don't!

04:59.450 --> 05:01.310
A decent show of resolve.

05:02.620 --> 05:03.780
Therefore...

05:03.780 --> 05:05.910
I shall grant you a reward.

05:10.500 --> 05:12.960
Hey, what the h...

05:15.550 --> 05:18.420
Aghagh! A demibeast!

05:18.800 --> 05:19.880
"Demibeast"?

05:28.300 --> 05:30.560
Unsightly, aren't they?

05:30.560 --> 05:34.730
These hideous inferiors
are infesting the city as we speak.

05:35.110 --> 05:37.820
The products of a tasteless game,

05:37.820 --> 05:41.820
birthed by a brute who has clearly
lost all sense of beauty.

05:44.660 --> 05:46.330
Capella...

05:46.330 --> 05:47.870
Don't tell me she did this...?

05:53.670 --> 05:57.130
What truly pitiful creatures.

05:57.800 --> 05:59.050
Therefore,

05:59.050 --> 06:02.840
in my great mercy,
I shall personally see to your last rites!

06:21.530 --> 06:25.780
You have witnessed the light of
the Yang Sword and learned of the demibeasts.

06:25.780 --> 06:28.740
Your reward is now complete.

06:31.700 --> 06:34.670
Just how strong are you, really...?

06:34.670 --> 06:38.420
Keep dawdling
and I'll leave you behind, peasant.

06:39.430 --> 06:41.880
My goal lies beyond here.

06:42.450 --> 06:47.600
You'd best etch the state of this city
into your eyes one more time.

06:52.850 --> 06:55.520
What the heck is with these vibes?

06:55.940 --> 06:57.900
Hm... Not here either, I see.

06:57.900 --> 07:01.400
Damn, even I'm getting ticked now!

07:01.790 --> 07:04.650
In the end, a mediocre man
remains a mediocrity,

07:04.650 --> 07:07.870
easily bewitched
after the slightest exposure.

07:08.280 --> 07:12.410
No way...
is Wrath's Authority doing all this?

07:12.410 --> 07:13.830
Hey, you!

07:13.830 --> 07:16.120
The hell are you staring at?!

07:16.120 --> 07:17.830
Just spill it already!

07:17.830 --> 07:20.800
Stop bitching around like a kid, jackass!

07:20.800 --> 07:23.800
- No, please stop it already!
- Shut up! Just shut your mouth!

07:23.800 --> 07:25.720
Have some self-control
like the rest of us!

07:30.100 --> 07:33.100
This is bad.
They're about to explode!

07:34.230 --> 07:35.430
Fool.

07:35.430 --> 07:38.400
You have lost your calm
as badly as they have.

07:38.400 --> 07:40.780
Sit back and listen quietly, peasant.

07:45.820 --> 07:47.110
I've had a revelation!

07:47.610 --> 07:49.030
Please lend me your ears:

07:49.030 --> 07:51.460
Pristella Wavers,
Reflected in the Water's Surface!

07:52.490 --> 08:02.420
♪ Recall the gentle stream's soft flow ♪

08:02.860 --> 08:09.890
♪ The joy that light begins to show ♪

08:10.300 --> 08:20.350
♪ Please don't forget the bustling streets ♪

08:20.350 --> 08:27.900
♪ That soothe your heart and bring you peace ♪

08:30.490 --> 08:37.330
♪ The breeze whisks away the sadness ♪

08:39.920 --> 08:46.800
♪ The waves wash away the conflicts ♪

08:48.590 --> 08:57.680
♪ I'm by your side, a shining dream ♪

08:58.040 --> 09:06.900
♪ Even tears can shine and gleam ♪

09:07.320 --> 09:17.620
♪ The jewels reflected
on the water's surface ♪

09:26.000 --> 09:28.730
Thank you for listening!

09:33.590 --> 09:34.720
Thank you, thank you!

09:34.720 --> 09:38.720
Apologies for the embarrassing sight!

09:38.720 --> 09:40.100
Liliana...

09:40.100 --> 09:42.560
Have you returned
to your senses, commoner?

09:42.560 --> 09:44.900
The diva has done well.

09:44.900 --> 09:48.320
That unsightly, meaningless reality
you just witnessed

09:48.320 --> 09:50.400
is everywhere in this city.

09:50.840 --> 09:54.990
You said this unpleasant atmosphere
was Wrath's Authority at work?

09:54.990 --> 09:58.990
Yeah. Wrath's Authority
stirs up people's emotions.

09:59.370 --> 10:02.290
Shelters full of anxious people
are her perfect prey.

10:03.500 --> 10:04.680
Priscilla, you—

10:04.680 --> 10:07.420
Then it's time for me to take the stage!

10:07.420 --> 10:12.880
Enchanting people with my songs
has always been my heart's desire!

10:13.220 --> 10:17.850
So, the goal you mentioned earlier
is to help Liliana visit all the shelters?

10:17.850 --> 10:21.930
Fool. I was simply looking for Schult.

10:22.600 --> 10:24.480
What's with that look on your face?

10:24.840 --> 10:25.790
It's nothing.

10:26.330 --> 10:29.690
I'm going back to Muse Company
to regroup with the others.

10:29.690 --> 10:30.730
What about you?

10:31.110 --> 10:33.200
I still have matters I must attend to.

10:33.200 --> 10:36.820
Right. Let's meet again after all this.

10:36.820 --> 10:37.910
Thanks for the help!

10:43.750 --> 10:46.630
Ah, it suits you well!

10:46.630 --> 10:50.210
I was right to dress you in white!

10:50.870 --> 10:51.920
Thanks...

10:51.920 --> 10:53.510
You look unhappy.

10:53.510 --> 10:55.930
That gloomy expression does not suit you.

10:55.930 --> 10:58.640
Is something troubling you?

11:01.390 --> 11:06.310
#184, did something happen
while she was getting dressed?

11:06.310 --> 11:10.570
It is likely due to Lady Capella's
broadcast just now.

11:10.950 --> 11:12.110
Broadcast...?

11:12.690 --> 11:14.700
Ah, that.

11:14.700 --> 11:20.530
I simply ignored it as I found that impure
wench's voice to be as grating as ever.

11:20.530 --> 11:24.540
I see. Hearing that voice for the first time
would upset any woman.

11:24.540 --> 11:26.120
Vile, wasn't it?

11:26.120 --> 11:31.300
But you needn't listen to the toxic slurs
of that unlovable broad.

11:31.300 --> 11:34.130
You have a face worthy of my love.

11:34.130 --> 11:35.380
Um...

11:35.380 --> 11:37.340
Still troubled?

11:37.740 --> 11:42.180
Now, with the ceremony approaching,
how can we mend my lovely bride's spirits?

11:45.140 --> 11:46.770
Such a gloomy face.

11:46.770 --> 11:48.270
Do you not have an answer?

11:48.690 --> 11:52.440
I'm sorry.
Um, I might still be a bit tired.

11:52.790 --> 11:54.280
Mind if I rest?

11:54.280 --> 11:58.990
I see. My apologies,
I wasn't attentive enough.

11:59.460 --> 12:02.310
My wives and I shall tend to
the venue's preparations,

12:02.310 --> 12:04.080
so you needn't worry.

12:04.080 --> 12:05.000
Venue?

12:05.790 --> 12:08.330
There's a chapel right next to us.

12:08.330 --> 12:11.540
All my wives are working hard
on the preparations.

12:12.090 --> 12:15.210
I've had a total of 291 wives.

12:15.210 --> 12:17.510
Sadly, death has taken
many of them from me.

12:17.960 --> 12:22.970
There are only 53 left,
with you as the 54th.

12:22.970 --> 12:27.640
Including you,
I love all of my wives equally.

12:27.640 --> 12:29.520
Th-Thank you...

12:29.520 --> 12:30.980
I'll keep that in mind.

12:30.980 --> 12:32.310
Good girl.

12:33.110 --> 12:35.780
By the way, I was thinking...

12:35.780 --> 12:40.030
It's true I was careless to overlook
my lovely bride's fatigue,

12:40.030 --> 12:46.700
but shouldn't the one closest
to her have noticed it?

12:47.000 --> 12:47.870
Watch out!

12:49.210 --> 12:50.870
Ah, my apologies!

12:50.870 --> 12:52.920
I acted on impulse.

12:52.920 --> 12:56.310
Now, I have matters to attend to,
so I'll be in the other room.

12:59.130 --> 13:00.510
Did he just...?

13:00.510 --> 13:03.020
Thank you for saving my life.

13:05.180 --> 13:07.730
Wait! This doesn't make sense!

13:07.730 --> 13:10.350
You were almost killed just now!

13:10.780 --> 13:13.520
I have already given you my thanks.

13:14.010 --> 13:17.070
Asking anything more of me
would infringe upon my rights.

13:17.070 --> 13:19.490
This isn't about rights or obligations!

13:19.490 --> 13:21.200
It's more important than that!

13:21.700 --> 13:24.240
Are all the wives
in the chapel like that too?

13:24.240 --> 13:28.090
Are they all cowering in fear of Regulus?

13:28.090 --> 13:31.160
Do they just stay quiet
even when they're about to be killed?!

13:31.160 --> 13:34.130
Some marriages are just like that.

13:34.790 --> 13:36.800
You'll get used to it.

13:36.800 --> 13:38.550
That doesn't make sense!

13:38.550 --> 13:40.740
Isn't marriage supposed to be
something happy

13:40.740 --> 13:42.760
that people do
because they're happy together?

13:42.760 --> 13:45.640
People can get married
even without happiness.

13:45.640 --> 13:48.230
Please do as Lord Husband said.

13:49.010 --> 13:51.520
This doesn't make sense at all...

13:54.150 --> 13:56.820
Get away! Don't touch me!

14:10.700 --> 14:12.210
Julius!

14:12.210 --> 14:14.790
Are you unharmed, Subaru?

14:14.790 --> 14:16.540
Barely, yeah.

14:16.540 --> 14:18.490
Glad to see you safe.

14:18.960 --> 14:19.920
Where are the others?

14:20.430 --> 14:25.300
With you here, I can now say the entire
city hall raid group made it out alive.

14:25.890 --> 14:29.470
However, Muse Company was attacked.

14:30.890 --> 14:33.270
What about the injured people inside?!

14:33.270 --> 14:35.100
What about Beatrice?!
And everyone else?!

14:35.100 --> 14:36.360
Calm down.

14:36.880 --> 14:39.730
We've relocated our headquarters
to the city hall.

14:40.190 --> 14:41.440
The city hall...?

14:41.880 --> 14:43.240
Is it ours again?

14:45.910 --> 14:47.530
You're useless!

14:49.490 --> 14:51.450
I have no excuse.

14:51.450 --> 14:52.870
Then make one up!

14:52.870 --> 14:56.960
Tell me there was no other way
so I can accept it!

14:57.450 --> 14:58.420
Why...

14:58.920 --> 15:00.840
Why won't anyone...

15:00.840 --> 15:02.590
Looks like yer back, pal.

15:02.590 --> 15:04.300
Here. Ya left this.

15:05.220 --> 15:06.720
You found it for me?

15:06.720 --> 15:10.850
Ya used it to tie the black dragon
and that duchess lady together.

15:10.850 --> 15:12.020
Yeah...

15:12.560 --> 15:14.310
Where's Ms. Crusch?

15:14.670 --> 15:16.440
She survived.

15:16.440 --> 15:17.770
However...

15:18.690 --> 15:22.010
I'll stay by Lady Crusch's side...

15:27.450 --> 15:28.950
You'd best leave them alone.

15:28.950 --> 15:30.920
She was a pretty lass.

15:30.920 --> 15:32.910
Lookin' at her right now
is downright painful.

15:33.610 --> 15:35.620
Lust must've done something to her.

15:36.080 --> 15:41.210
A foreign substance is spreading through
Lady Crusch's body, tormenting her internally.

15:47.260 --> 15:48.810
Dragon blood...

15:53.520 --> 15:54.730
This should do.

16:07.450 --> 16:08.660
Right.

16:08.660 --> 16:13.450
They've taken all four towers,
so the city is helpless.

16:13.880 --> 16:17.660
Since the cathedral is right nearby,
this must be District 3.

16:18.460 --> 16:20.540
If there are multiple
Archbishops in the city,

16:20.540 --> 16:25.210
knowing who's in each tower
should help Subaru and the others.

16:25.210 --> 16:26.630
Now listen here.

16:26.630 --> 16:30.840
All I want is to hold a wedding ceremony
for my fated bride!

16:31.230 --> 16:34.930
I have no interest in whatever
you're doing, you see.

16:35.370 --> 16:39.230
However, opening the watergate
was simply unacceptable.

16:39.230 --> 16:42.230
Your selfish actions
have made my lovely bride anxious,

16:42.230 --> 16:47.440
sullying my wedding, which was supposed
to be the happiest moment of my life!

16:47.440 --> 16:49.910
You are gravely infringing upon my rights!

16:51.160 --> 16:55.120
I can see your tower
quite clearly from here.

16:55.490 --> 16:58.580
At this distance, blowing it away
would be but a trifle.

17:00.000 --> 17:03.590
What's this? You weren't the one
who opened the watergate?

17:03.590 --> 17:06.760
What kind of a pathetic excuse is that?

17:07.160 --> 17:09.000
Repulsive, impure wench!

17:10.090 --> 17:12.590
Lord Husband, may I enter?

17:13.350 --> 17:14.720
You may.

17:16.350 --> 17:19.520
We're about to start decorating
the venue's interior.

17:19.520 --> 17:22.020
Ah, has that much time already passed?

17:22.650 --> 17:24.150
I'll be there right away.

17:27.990 --> 17:29.320
That was close.

17:29.990 --> 17:35.660
If this is District 3,
then the tower ahead must be District 1's.

17:35.660 --> 17:40.540
And from their talk just now,
the Archbishop of Lust is over there.

17:41.210 --> 17:43.610
I have to let Subaru know about this.

17:47.090 --> 17:49.210
I'll be straight with you.

17:49.800 --> 17:52.180
Beatrice is an artificial spirit, right?

17:53.510 --> 17:54.590
That's right.

17:54.590 --> 17:56.640
Beatrice is an artificial spirit.

17:57.180 --> 17:59.680
Well, you're awfully honest about this.

17:59.680 --> 18:02.100
We're trying to figure out
who the enemy is after.

18:02.100 --> 18:04.980
Hiding it now
will just make it easier for them.

18:05.810 --> 18:07.610
Easier for the enemy, huh?

18:08.480 --> 18:11.190
Right. You're completely right.

18:11.700 --> 18:14.780
Speaking of,
there's something else you have to know.

18:14.780 --> 18:18.660
It's about their other demand,
the Book of Wisdom.

18:18.660 --> 18:20.290
Care to explain?

18:20.290 --> 18:23.870
I can't find anythin' about that book.

18:24.420 --> 18:28.920
The Book of Wisdom is the prototype
of the Witch Cult's Gospels.

18:29.380 --> 18:31.510
It's basically the complete version.

18:31.880 --> 18:33.510
Where did you hear that from?

18:33.510 --> 18:35.090
From the Witch who made it.

18:35.090 --> 18:36.760
Directly from... the Witch...?

18:36.760 --> 18:38.510
Are you certain?

18:38.510 --> 18:40.470
Yeah, I'm dead serious here.

18:41.370 --> 18:44.440
I met one, got tricked, and was set up.

18:44.440 --> 18:46.440
A lot happened, alright?

18:46.860 --> 18:49.900
Anyway, there were two Books of Wisdom,

18:50.610 --> 18:52.990
but both have already been incinerated.

18:52.990 --> 18:55.760
There shouldn't be any left now.

18:56.760 --> 19:00.950
Is it possible the Witch Cult
doesn't know they're gone?

19:00.950 --> 19:02.750
Yeah, that's right.

19:02.750 --> 19:07.750
Last, is the silver-haired
maiden's wedding ceremony.

19:08.160 --> 19:13.130
These nutjobs better think twice
if they expect me to give them any of those!

19:13.130 --> 19:15.260
Right, exactly.

19:15.260 --> 19:17.590
We won't hear any of
the Witch Cult's demands.

19:17.920 --> 19:21.350
Mr. Kiritaka entrusted this city to me.

19:21.690 --> 19:22.740
What happened to him?

19:23.280 --> 19:24.940
He's missin'.

19:24.940 --> 19:27.190
So I have a duty I must fulfill.

19:27.620 --> 19:29.270
All debts must be settled.

19:29.770 --> 19:33.190
Can't call myself
a Kararagi merchant otherwise!

19:34.360 --> 19:38.870
The citizens are currently
in their designated shelters.

19:39.180 --> 19:42.040
The people are anxious and irritable,

19:42.040 --> 19:45.160
and in some shelters,
there have been instances

19:45.160 --> 19:47.370
where their stress
has boiled over into violence.

19:47.920 --> 19:51.710
We're doing everything
to contain the damage...

19:51.710 --> 19:53.920
...but some shelters were beyond savin'.

19:53.920 --> 19:56.270
There have been more than
a few casualties already.

19:56.270 --> 19:58.970
We'd be cowards
if we looked away from reality.

19:58.970 --> 20:00.510
Lady Anastasia...

20:00.510 --> 20:03.520
People have died, and more will follow.

20:03.520 --> 20:08.190
We've chosen to save as many as we can,
but we'll have to leave some behind.

20:08.190 --> 20:11.940
I think you're misunderstanding
something, Anastasia.

20:12.400 --> 20:17.900
I never said anything about
sacrificing the few to save the many.

20:17.900 --> 20:20.410
You're talkin' nonsense again.

20:20.410 --> 20:24.080
I thought you'd changed
since I met you in the castle.

20:24.080 --> 20:27.750
Besides, people died in your fight
against the White Whale, y'know?

20:27.750 --> 20:29.210
You're a full-fledged knight now—

20:29.210 --> 20:32.840
Those soldiers were ready
to lay down their lives in that battle.

20:33.250 --> 20:36.010
You can't demand the same
from ordinary folks

20:36.010 --> 20:38.510
whose home was suddenly
turned into a battlefield.

20:38.510 --> 20:40.510
The cultists made their decision,

20:40.510 --> 20:43.810
and only those with at least
equal resolve should face them.

20:44.160 --> 20:47.350
To me, being a knight means
living your life with that resolve

20:47.350 --> 20:49.520
while keeping that distinction.

20:49.940 --> 20:52.610
That's why I won't sacrifice anyone.

20:52.610 --> 20:54.020
I won't leave anyone behind.

20:54.400 --> 20:57.190
As a knight, that's something
I can't, no, won't give up.

20:57.190 --> 20:59.030
I'm Emilia's knight.

20:59.030 --> 21:00.910
I want to fight for her sake.

21:01.400 --> 21:04.780
But that doesn't mean
she's the only one I'll protect.

21:04.780 --> 21:06.830
I won't be satisfied with that!

21:07.260 --> 21:09.410
Julius, aren't you the same?

21:11.500 --> 21:15.300
Knights are greedy and want to look cool.

21:15.300 --> 21:18.130
I'll keep acting cool even if it kills me.

21:19.220 --> 21:21.340
We'll save Emilia from that creep,

21:21.680 --> 21:25.220
beat Gluttony and make him
cough up Rem's memories,

21:25.220 --> 21:28.680
kick Sirius' ass for messing
with everyone's emotions,

21:28.680 --> 21:34.020
and make Capella beg for forgiveness
and change everyone back.

21:35.400 --> 21:37.980
Then we save the city,

21:37.980 --> 21:40.400
A KNIGHT'S CODE
and everyone lives happily ever after.

21:40.400 --> 21:41.990
A KNIGHT'S CODE

23:26.680 --> 23:28.750
This was the meteor he was using.

23:33.520 --> 23:35.890
Oh? Someone picked up.

23:37.800 --> 23:39.000
Al?
